{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "Planning Service - AI Planner Endpoints",
    "description": "Postman collection for testing the Mongez Planning Service, including the AI Planner endpoints.\n\nBase URL: http://localhost:8082\n\nAI Planner Flow:\n1. Create a course (POST /courses)\n2. Upload a material (POST /courses/{courseId}/materials) — this uploads the file and triggers AI plan generation\n3. Check schedule (POST /courses/{courseId}/check-schedule) — AI reschedules missed tasks\n\nRequired Headers:\n- X-User-Id: <your-user-id>\n- Content-Type: multipart/form-data (for material upload)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "AI Planner",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Check & Reschedule Schedule",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-User-Id",
                "value": "user-123",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Daily-Study-Minutes",
                "value": "60",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Preferred-Days",
                "value": "MON,TUE,WED,THU,FRI,SAT,SUN",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8082/courses/{{courseId}}/check-schedule",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8082",
              "path": ["courses", "{{courseId}}", "check-schedule"]
            },
            "description": "AI planner endpoint that checks the schedule for missed tasks and reschedules them. Uses the StudyPlannerAgent to detect missed tasks and reschedule around available study days.\n\nPath Parameters:\n- courseId: UUID of the course\n\nHeaders:\n- X-User-Id (required): The user's ID\n- X-Daily-Study-Minutes (optional, default=60): Daily study time in minutes\n- X-Preferred-Days (optional, default=MON,TUE,WED,THU,FRI,SAT,SUN): Comma-separated preferred study days\n\nResponse:\n{\n  \"status\": \"ok\" | \"rescheduled\" | \"error\",\n  \"alert\": {\n    \"message\": \"...\"\n  }\n}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Courses",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Add Material to Course",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-User-Id",
                "value": "user-123",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Daily-Study-Minutes",
                "value": "60",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Preferred-Days",
                "value": "MON,TUE,WED,THU,FRI,SAT,SUN",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "request",
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "{\n  \"file_name\": \"chapter1.pdf\",\n  \"content_type\": \"application/pdf\",\n  \"file_size_bytes\": 1048576,\n  \"page_count\": 20\n}",
                  "description": "JSON metadata about the material"
                },
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": "https://www.w3.org/WAI/ER/tests/xhtml/testfiles/resources/pdf/dummy.pdf",
                  "description": "PDF file of the course material"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8082/courses/{{courseId}}/materials",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8082",
              "path": ["courses", "{{courseId}}", "materials"]
            },
            "description": "Creates a material and uploads the PDF file, triggering the AI planner to generate a study plan. The AI extracts tasks from the PDF, queries available calendar slots, schedules study blocks, and persists the plan.\n\nHeaders:\n- X-User-Id (required): The user's ID\n- X-Daily-Study-Minutes (optional, default=60): Daily study time in minutes\n- X-Preferred-Days (optional, default=MON,TUE,WED,THU,FRI,SAT,SUN): Comma-separated preferred study days\n\nForm Data:\n- request: JSON metadata (file_name, content_type, file_size_bytes, page_count)\n- file: PDF file of the course material\n\nResponse:\n{\n  \"materialId\": \"...\",\n  \"name\": \"...\",\n  \"pageCount\": 0,\n  \"fileSizeMb\": 0.0,\n  \"status\": \"uploaded\" | \"processing\",\n  \"uploadedAt\": \"...\"\n}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Material",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-User-Id",
                "value": "user-123",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "http://localhost:8082/courses/{{courseId}}/materials/{{materialId}}",
              "protocol": "http",
              "host": ["localhost"],
              "port": "8082",
              "path": ["courses", "{{courseId}}", "materials", "{{materialId}}"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
